<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div align="center" style=""><div align="center" style="text-align: center;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">On eligible Qantas operated flights between Australia and New Zealand.*</font></div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2028492550/qantas-header+19+2+680x70.jpg" title="Major Announcement" style="width: 680px;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi [Name],</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you for your time on the phone.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">To celebrate the opening of the trans-Tasman bubble, we're welcoming Frequent Flyers back on board with more rewards on eligible Qantas flights between Australia and New Zealand.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Simply make a new booking on any eligible Qantas flight and you'll be rewarded with&nbsp;<strong>5,000 bonus points when you book and double Status Credits when you fly</strong>.*</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); line-height: 20px;"><strong><font face="Arial, sans-serif">How you can earn 5,000 bonus points and double Status Credits:</font></strong><ol style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px;"><li style="font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><span style="font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Register for the offer by&nbsp;<strong>11.59pm (AEST) 15 May 2021</strong>.</font></span></li><li style="font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><span style="font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Make a new booking&nbsp;<strong>between 10 and 15 May 2021, for travel between 17 May 2021 and 28 February 2022</strong>&nbsp;on any Qantas operated flights with a QF flight number between Australia and New Zealand.*</font></span></li><li style="font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><span style="font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Ensure your Qantas Frequent Flyer number is included in the booking.</font></span></li></ol></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">With unlimited fee-free date changes for travel before 28 February 2022,<span style="vertical-align: 2px; font-size: 12px; bottom: 0.5ex; position: relative;">+</span>&nbsp;it's a great way to help you reach your next reward sooner.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Bonus points will be credited to your account up to 6 weeks after booking and Bonus Status Credits will be credited to your account up to 6 weeks after travel. Make sure you check the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/travel-updates.html?alt_cam=au:ff:in:edm:ff:spc-dsc-promo-tasman:initial-bodycopy:governmenttravelrequirements:trans-tasman:n#new-zealand-australia" target="_blank" title="Travel Requirements" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">latest government travel requirements</a>&nbsp;before you book.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Why wait? Book with confidence today.&nbsp;<strong>Offer ends 11.59pm (AEST) 15 May 2021</strong>.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; width: 600px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 40px;"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="left" class="w100perc" style="margin: 0px auto;"><tbody><tr><td width="6" align="right" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 0px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="file://corp.qf.qantas.com.au/Profiles/SYDQCX/626432/Desktop/Untitled-1.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543098/qa_primary_cta_l.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></font></a></td><td height="40" bgcolor="#E40000" align="center" valign="middle" class="w100perc applelinkwhite" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 16px; height: 40px; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0px 10px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/member-offers/bonus-points-double-status-credits-open-may21.html" target="_blank" alt="" title="Register and book now" style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Register and book now &gt;</font></a></td><td width="6" align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 0px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="file://corp.qf.qantas.com.au/Profiles/SYDQCX/626432/Desktop/Untitled-1.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543099/qa_primary_cta_r.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2036585926/9792-Loyalty-Campaign_680x300_Proof-Points.jpg" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" width="600" style="width: 600px; display: block;"></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr width="600px;" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 20px;"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; font-weight: 400;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Stay up to date with travel requirements</font></h3><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Check the latest Government travel restrictions, which may include mandatory health declarations, use of face masks, entry permits, pre-approval and quarantine (possibly at your own expense), or you could be denied entry.<br><br><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/travel-updates.html?alt_cam=au:ff:in:e